                                "sense_id": "897f1731-a689-3f42-91c8-33b631a6c875",
                                "text": "1859, “Dodge’s improved open fire-grate,” Scientific American, New Series, Volume 1, No. 1, 2 July, 1859, p. 6,\n[…] the one which we have had for some time enables us to speak thus commendatorily of its advantages."
